    <!-- Location sheet -->
    <string name="location_sheet_title">Your location</string>
    <!-- The second paragraph exists because a tester was shown his county instead of his
         town and reasonably assumed his prayer times were wrong too. The "about a minute"
         figure is measured, not estimated: PrayerEngine over a 10-mile radius at UK
         latitude moves every prayer by at most 2 minutes, in midsummer, midwinter and
         between. See HANDOVER §10. Shown only when the user opens this sheet — the app
         does not volunteer it, and it is not a second disclaimer. -->
    <string name="location_sheet_body">Prayer times and the Qibla both depend on where you are. Update this whenever you travel.\n\nTo protect your privacy the app only ever asks for your approximate position, so it may name a nearby town or the wider area rather than yours. That changes the times very little — ten miles is about a minute. If the name looks wrong to you, type your city below.</string>
    <string name="action_use_my_location">Use my current location</string>
    <string name="location_sheet_search_heading">Or type a city</string>

